<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#hasConnection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#ManagementService> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#hasConnection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#ManagementConnection> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#hasConnection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A relationship between a Management Service and a Management Connection, indicating that the Management Service exists solely because of the Management Connection. If the Management Connection ceases to exist, the Management Service will also cease to exist.."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#hasConnection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has connection"@en .
