<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceName> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Name for an instance of a datamodel parameter."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Datamodel parameter instance name"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceProperty
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceProperty> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceProperty> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Property kind that represents the properties of a Datamodel Parameter Instance.\n\nThese parameter instances represent the actionable capabilities of the Device in a format specific to the datamodel implemented by the Device, and exposed by the Client.\n\nIt should not be confused with the Supported Datamodel Parameter, which represents the abstract capabilities of the Device."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Datamodel parameter instance property"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceValue
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceValue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceValue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://saref.etsi.org/core/Property> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceValue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Value of a datamodel parameter instance, obtained as the result of the execution of a Datamodel parameter retrieval command."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterInstanceValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Datamodel parameter instance value"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterOperateCommand
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterOperateCommand> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterOperateCommand> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterCommandCategory> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterOperateCommand> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Command to trigger the execution of a datamodel parameter instance that corresponds to an executable process on a device."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterOperateCommand> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Datamodel parameter operate command"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterRetrievalCommand
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterRetrievalCommand> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterRetrievalCommand> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterCommandCategory> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterRetrievalCommand> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Command to retrieve the value of a Datamodel parameter instance."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterRetrievalCommand> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Datamodel parameter retrieval command"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterUpdateCommand
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterUpdateCommand> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterUpdateCommand> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterCommandCategory> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterUpdateCommand> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Command to update the value of a Datamodel parameter instance."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DatamodelParameterUpdateCommand> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Datamodel parameter update command"@en .
