# https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceControlFunction
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceControlFunction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceControlFunction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceManagementFunctionCategory> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceControlFunction> <https://saref.etsi.org/core/hasCommand> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#RebootCommand> .
