<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceControlFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Function kind to control the global state of the device, e.g., its power state through the Reboot function, or the global configuration through the Reset function."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceControlFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Device control function"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceIdentityFunction
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceIdentityFunction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceIdentityFunction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#DeviceManagementFunctionCategory> .
