<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#FirmwareInformationRetrievalCommand> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Command to retrieve firmware information such as the current firmware version for a device."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#FirmwareInformationRetrievalCommand> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Firmware information retrieval command"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#FirmwareManagementFunction
