<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#FirmwareProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Property kind that represents the properties of the firmware of a device.\n\nThe device firmware is the running base software for a device, which is automatically loaded into memory and executed at boot."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dmont/ontology#FirmwareProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Firmware property"@en .
